repository-code: "https://github.com/LizzoLizard/balanced-boolean-nonlinearity"
abstract: >-
  For every m >= 4, every balanced Boolean function on 2m variables has nonlinearity at most
  2^(2m-1) - 2^(m-1) - 4. Paper and complete Lean 4 proof.
